    }
  ],
  "staticRationale": [
    "Measured fixed context uses wrapped label minimum heights at the integer MarginContainer inner width, with ceil per VBox child and current theme separations/margins.",
    "Pinning is rejected unless fixed header/context plus existing 220-unit scroll-stage budget fits. Rejected context is removed and queued for deletion; unchanged public-info fallback retains rank, turn, full claim and guidance.",
    "The hand toggle remains governed by the original header condition; fixed-context fit does not alter hand visibility state.",
    "All existing action callbacks, action enablement, private rendering, controller and diagnostic observer functions remain unchanged.",
    "Only one renderer source file differs; no bridge, authority, admission, discovery, or observer changes."
